      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "We trained 4.7 on longer-running problems compared to Grok 4.6. It holds context better and checks its own work more carefully.\n\nGive it a try and let us know your feedback!",
      "quote": {
        "author": "SpaceXAI",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2074224934159876096/aelorWHq_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-09-22 00:17:53",
