      "text": "The only thing that matters is that the customer never feels the need to run a speed test. I ran speed tests far more on cable than I do on Starlink. It just works.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "BassonBrain",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2080740182546903040/kujG_BH5_200x200.jpg",
