          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSra-w-WwAAQ5nz.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "name": "Brian Basson",
        "text": "STARLINK IS NOW COMPETING WITH THE BEST-RATED ISPs 🔥\n\nThe latest CNET People’s Picks study gives Starlink an overall satisfaction score of 4.47 out of 5, \n\ncompared with 4.20 for T-Mobile Home Internet and 4.16 for Verizon Fios. \n\nThe reliability result is even more interesting:\n\n@Starlink scores 4.59 out of 5, only slightly behind GFiber at 4.70. A few years ago it would have been difficult to imagine a satellite broadband provider being perceived as this reliable.\n\n\"Satellite broadband was supposed to be the compromise. Now Starlink sits alongside some of America’s highest-rated broadband providers, revealing what customers actually value most.\"",
        "url": "https://x.com/BassonBrain/status/2101732988505706706",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
